  "body": "Positioned in the heart of Browns Bay, on the flat and just minutes from the beach, 6/3 Glen Road puts coastal living right at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nGrab a coffee in the village, spend your afternoons by the beach or enjoy dinner at one of the local favourites. With shops, cafes, restaurants and everyday essentials close by, this is a location that makes life easy.\r\n\r\nSpread across three levels, the townhouse offers a versatile layout with room to spread out. The ground floor features a separate kitchen alongside the living area, with access to a courtyard that connects to a generous shared backyard, providing extra outdoor space to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThree well-sized bedrooms across the upper levels offer flexibility for first-home buyers, young families, flatmates or those needing space to work from home.\r\n\r\nImprovements have already been made, with further work and finishing touches to consider, giving buyers the opportunity to make the home their own.\r\n\r\nPractical features include a heater, separate laundry, full bathroom, an additional guest toilet, a single garage and one off-street car park.\r\n\r\n**WHY YOU'LL LOVE IT:**\r\n\r\n* Three bedrooms across three levels\r\n* Separate kitchen and adjoining living area\r\n* Courtyard connecting to a generous shared backyard\r\n* Improvements made, with further potential\r\n* Single garage plus one off-street car park\r\n* Separate laundry and additional guest toilet\r\n* Flat walk to Browns Bay Beach and village\r\n* Close to cafes, restaurants, supermarkets, schools and public transport\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, looking for an investment or wanting a home close to the beach and village, 6/3 Glen Road is worth a closer look.\r\n\r\nWith Browns Bay on your doorstep and the opportunity to make it your own, this is coastal convenience with plenty of potential.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctional agents welcome!\r\n\r\n**6/3 Glen Road, Browns Bay**\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35781",
